<title>USA: Presstek Inc Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Presstek Inc Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>HUDSON, N.H. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except Per Share)</p>
<p>					 Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>				   Dec. 28  Dec. 30  Dec. 28  Dec. 30</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   $13,377  $9,395 $48,628 $27,611</p>
<p> Net Income			   2,354   1,651   7,121   2,860</p>
<p>Net Income per share:</p>
<p> Primary				  .14     .10     .43     .18</p>
<p> Fully diluted			  .14     .10     .43     .18</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
