<p>NOTE - On April 19, 1996, the company's board of directors authorized a two-for-one stock split, effected in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend, during the second quarter of 1995. All references to average number of shares outstanding and prices per share have been restated retroactively to reflect the split.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
